  "memory_facts": [
    "The project is to build a snake game in Python.",
    "The showcase for the game is on the 20th.",
    "The game must be dependency-free (standard library only).",
    "The rendering method will be a plain text grid to stdout, without using curses.",
    "Input will be handled via a non-blocking read for portability.",
    "Marcus is responsible for the game loop and collision.",
    "Aisha is responsible for rendering and the grid.",
    "Tom is responsible for writing the tests.",
    "Priya will review the project.",
    "Tom will prioritize writing tests for collision and growth.",
    "The game grid size is 20x20.",
    "The snake starts with a length of 3.",
    "The snake starts in the middle of the grid.",
    "The snake starts moving right."
  ],
